tick=1 note the apiserver sheds the recovery create and asks for half a minute, so the pass stamps the attempt, writes no pod and wakes no earlier than asked
tick=1 apply api.throttled[TooManyRequests] verb=create resource=pods count=1 retryAfter=30s now=t+0s
tick=1 hold cleared
